Package: keystats
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.7), python3-evdev, systemd
Recommends: sqlite3
Maintainer: Your Name <your.email@example.com>
Description: Lightweight keyboard activity monitor
 Keystats is a minimal, system-wide keyboard statistics collector.
 It runs as a background daemon and tracks daily keypress counts
 without recording the actual content typed, ensuring privacy.
 .
 Features include:
  - Real-time keypress counting via Linux evdev
  - SQLite storage with minimal resource usage
  - Daily, weekly, and all-time statistics
  - Hourly activity breakdown
  - Daily summary with insights
  - systemd integration for auto-start
